S = {'cc': 'GY', 'fam': 'Social', 'doc': '# Guyana 2025: employer National Insurance (2200)\n\nSource: National Insurance Scheme, "Information on contributions" (nis.org.gy, the 1.x builder\'s copy read 2026-11-20,\n`world/B13-caribbean/gy/law/nis_org_gy_information_on_contributions_2026-11-20.html`), official secondary for the\nNational Insurance and Social Security Act Cap. 36:01 regulations: "The total Contribution for Employed Contributors is\n14% of the actual Wage / Salary"; the employee\'s deduction is 5.6 % (1.x model), so the employer pays 8.4 %; "Monthly\nCeiling ... January 2020 280,000". Grade B.', 'lean': 'def nis : Contribution := Contribution.flatCapped "NIS (employer)" 840 (280000 * 12)\ndef sscF : Family := employerFamily "2200 NIS employer" [nis] "NIS: total 14 % less the employee\'s 5.6 % = 8.4 % to $280,000 a month (ceiling from January 2020)"', 'families': '[sscF]', 'unsupported': [['g.household.adults.any (·.wages > 0)', 'employer NIS 8.4 % (14 % total less the 5.6 % employee deduction); ages outside 16-60 not distinguished']], 'guards': ['nis.amount 1000000 == 84000', 'nis.amount 10000000 == 282240'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'NIS (employer)', 'statute': 'National Insurance and Social Security Act Cap. 36:01 (via nis.org.gy)', 'dated': 'nis.org.gy contribution page (ceiling since January 2020)', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': ['employerFamily', 'Contribution']}]}
